{"skill":{"slug":"windows-control","displayName":"Windows Control"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769988173399,"changelog":"**Major update: Adds full desktop automation with robust window, UI, and dialog control.**\n\n- NEW: Control mouse, keyboard, screenshots, and interact with any Windows application via scripts.\n- NEW: Comprehensive window management (focus, minimize, maximize, close, get active window).\n- NEW: Advanced UI automation: click buttons/links by name, read UI elements, robust dialog handling.\n- NEW: Read actual window and browser text using Windows UI Automation (not OCR).\n- NEW: Extract and interact with webpage content, including buttons, links, and structure.\n- Enhanced automation reliability with wait/find routines and smooth mouse movement.\n- Safety features: failsafe mouse-abort, small delays, and user-friendly workflow documentation.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"package.json","size":441,"sha256":"5d046d461ea16a00cc1d9eff83d418bf50f85d194b9a72bf3e1249bb18e219ab","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7434,"sha256":"3e294c19edeb780b402a79c93c48f3758a7a691463dca5c337f422ffc97e8a11","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/click.py","size":601,"sha256":"b971fc7fa90e326c4a34a80838740702a968d7a65f448c0185bbf7de8247171f","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"scripts/click_element.py","size":6448,"sha256":"ed5c7f8954105dc8e4f3a1531bd76acf89900bda6a95af72da4d01e006767335","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"scripts/click_text.py","size":1957,"sha256":"2731eacc65977a8ef3917564251f299654a7decd0d4daf4b6b8ed09a8472987a","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"scripts/close_window.py","size":804,"sha256":"f5165ec808f382a09f65818b476524c17c4716d9399c9cc5b85d8c68b0960be3","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"scripts/drag.py","size":695,"sha256":"34ed66d9711f59fbc482f3b7c61d8828c3fd1191dded2aff9fd5a71fc400a23e","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"scripts/find_text.py","size":1741,"sh